sequenceDiagram
    participant Orchestrator as Guardrails Orchestrator
    participant Axum as Axum HTTP Server<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant Handler as Detection Handler
    participant Builtin as Built-in Detectors<br/>(email, ssn, credit-card)
    participant Custom as User Regex Compiler

    Note over Orchestrator,Custom: Inbound Detection Request Flow

    Orchestrator->>Axum: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>Content-Type: application/json<br/>{"contents": [...], "detector_params": {"regex": [...]}}
    Axum->>Axum: TraceLayer logs request
    Axum->>Handler: Route to handle_text_contents

    alt Built-in detector (email, ssn, credit-card)
        Handler->>Builtin: Dispatch to built-in detector
        Builtin->>Builtin: Match regex patterns against content
        Builtin-->>Handler: Detection results<br/>(position, type, score)
    else User-supplied regex pattern
        Handler->>Custom: Compile user regex at request time
        Custom->>Custom: Match compiled regex against content
        Custom-->>Handler: Detection results<br/>(position, type, score)
    end

    Handler-->>Axum: JSON response with detections
    Axum->>Axum: TraceLayer logs response
    Axum-->>Orchestrator: 200 OK<br/>{"detections": [...]}

    Note over Orchestrator,Custom: Health Check Flow

    participant Probe as Kubernetes Probe

    Probe->>Axum: GET /health
    Axum-->>Probe: 200 OK "healthy"

    Note over Orchestrator,Custom: No outbound calls are made by this service
